  "limits": "The bilge is a parabola in height, not a measured cooperage curve. Staves are faceted (one chord per stave across its width) and have no bevel, chime chamfer or bung hole. Hoops are plain rectangular bands with no rivets. The volume is the outer volume from the profile, not the inner capacity. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
